          %title Contents
          %blockquote
            %p
              This entry is about the conjectured relation (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/duality+in+string+theory"}> duality
              ) between
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
              at
              = succeed "-planes" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MO9"} MO9
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string+theory"} heterotic string theory
              on these. For the relation of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactified
              on a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K3-surface"} K3-surface
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string+theory"} heterotic string theory
              on a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3-torus"} 3-torus
              see instead at
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/duality+between+M%2FF-theory+and+heterotic+string+theory"} duality between M/F-theory and heterotic string theory
          %hr/
